WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:03.401
(piano music)

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:12.681
- [Michael] A castell is a
structure formed of human people.

00:00:12.681 --> 00:00:14.737
It's a human tower.

00:00:14.737 --> 00:00:19.437
Castells are a Catalan
tradition of over 200 years.

00:00:19.437 --> 00:00:23.421
Today, there are over 80
different colles or teams

00:00:23.421 --> 00:00:25.324
spread throughout Catalunya.

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:27.261
Every two years we have a competition.

00:00:27.261 --> 00:00:31.096
The twelve best teams will
perform at the Concurs

00:00:31.096 --> 00:00:32.179
in Tarragona.

00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:36.576
I'm proud to be a member of
the Castellers de Vilafranca.

00:00:36.576 --> 00:00:39.499
The Castellers de Vilafranca
have won the Concurs

00:00:39.499 --> 00:00:42.277
for seven consecutive times.

00:00:42.277 --> 00:00:46.364
We hope to make it eight
consecutive victories.

00:00:46.364 --> 00:00:48.740
These are very big
structures, very big castles

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:51.627
and they require three or
four hundred people at a time

00:00:51.627 --> 00:00:54.442
to make these kind of
constructions and they can reach

00:00:54.442 --> 00:00:56.192
heights of 15 meters.

00:00:58.882 --> 00:01:02.032
The most important thing when
we try to make the castles

00:01:02.032 --> 00:01:04.924
is obviously the safety
of the people involved.

00:01:04.924 --> 00:01:08.109
We have very small children
of the age of four or five

00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:10.617
who will climb to the
very top of the castle.

00:01:10.617 --> 00:01:13.836
Everybody is working to make
sure that this is the safest

00:01:13.836 --> 00:01:16.032
possible activity for them.

00:01:16.032 --> 00:01:19.030
This is very important
because occasionally castles

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:23.715
will collapse and it looks
spectacular but it can be

00:01:23.715 --> 00:01:25.310
very dangerous.

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:29.019
It's quite common for people
to break a leg, an arm,

00:01:29.019 --> 00:01:30.519
shoulder injuries.

00:01:34.313 --> 00:01:37.359
As the castle progresses,
the pressure builds.

00:01:37.359 --> 00:01:40.509
Everybody is trying to find
the little bit of oxygen

00:01:40.509 --> 00:01:42.524
in the bottom of the castle.

00:01:42.524 --> 00:01:45.520
There have been times when
people have fainted or collapsed,

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:47.980
but you still have to keep
going because you have

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:50.187
the collective responsibility
that you don't want to let

00:01:50.187 --> 00:01:51.354
the team down.

00:01:53.062 --> 00:01:55.203
When you hear the final music
that you know the castle

00:01:55.203 --> 00:01:57.805
is completed, you can relax
a little bit but you still

00:01:57.805 --> 00:02:00.627
have to concentrate because
this is the most dangerous part

00:02:00.627 --> 00:02:03.404
of the castle because if you
relax too much, the structure

00:02:03.404 --> 00:02:06.071
can collapse very, very quickly.

00:02:06.948 --> 00:02:09.861
Why am I a Casteller de Vilafranca?

00:02:09.861 --> 00:02:12.903
This is a very complex question
and I don't really have

00:02:12.903 --> 00:02:14.267
an answer.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:17.046
You can't explain it, it's
impossible to explain.

00:02:17.046 --> 00:02:18.449
You have to feel it.

00:02:18.449 --> 00:02:21.282
If you feel it, you understand it.

